          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:16px;transition:transform 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.transform='translateX(6px)'" onmouseout="this.style.transform='translateX(0)'">
          <div style="width:40px;height:40px;background:#FAB31E;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;"><span style="font-family:'GillSans',sans-serif;font-size:16px;color:#235E44;font-weight:700;">✦</span></div>
          <div>
            <div style="font-family:'GillSans',sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#FFF1DA;margin-bottom:4px;">Exclusive tasting events</div>
            <div style="font-family:'GillSans',sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:300;color:rgba(255,241,218,0.55);line-height:1.6;">Private evenings with our chef — intimate, off-menu, and only for Bianca Club members.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:16px;transition:transform 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.transform='translateX(6px)'" onmouseout="this.style.transform='translateX(0)'">
          <div style="width:40px;height:40px;background:#FAB31E;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;"><span style="font-family:'GillSans',sans-serif;font-size:16px;color:#235E44;font-weight:700;">✦</span></div>
          <div>
            <div style="font-family:'GillSans',sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#FFF1DA;margin-bottom:4px;">Members-only offers</div>
            <div style="font-family:'GillSans',sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:300;color:rgba(255,241,218,0.55);line-height:1.6;">Priority reservations, birthday surprises, and rewards that grow the longer you stay.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:16px;transition:transform 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.transform='translateX(6px)'" onmouseout="this.style.transform='translateX(0)'">
          <div style="width:40px;height:40px;background:#FAB31E;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;"><span style="font-family:'GillSans',sans-serif;font-size:16px;color:#235E44;font-weight:700;">✦</span></div>
          <div>
            <div style="font-family:'GillSans',sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#FFF1DA;margin-bottom:4px;">Kitchen stories & recipes</div>
            <div style="font-family:'GillSans',sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:300;color:rgba(255,241,218,0.55);line-height:1.6;">Monthly letters from our kitchen — stories, recipes, and the thinking behind what we cook.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="club-reveal" style="margin-top:36px;padding-top:32px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,241,218,0.1);opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px);transition:all 0.6s ease 0.5s;">
        <div style="font-family:'GillSans',sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.15em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(255,241,218,0.4);margin-bottom:14px;">Also find us on</div>
        <a href="https://line.me/R/ti/p/@biancabangkok" target="_blank" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;background:#06C755;color:#fff;padding:11px 20px;text-decoration:none;transition:all 0.3s;" onmouseover="this.style.transform='translateY(-2px)';this.style.boxShadow='0 6px 20px rgba(6,199,85,0.3)'" onmouseout="this.style.transform='translateY(0)';this.style.boxShadow='none'">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="white"><path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12c0 4.95 3.61 9.05 8.34 9.82V15.5H8.5v-2.5h1.84v-1.6c0-1.82 1.08-2.82 2.74-2.82.79 0 1.62.14 1.62.14v1.78h-.91c-.9 0-1.18.56-1.18 1.13v1.37h2.01l-.32 2.5h-1.69v6.32C18.39 21.05 22 16.95 22 12c0-5.52-4.48-10-10-10z"/></svg>
          <span style="font-family:'GillSans',sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.06em;">LINE OA — @biancabangkok</span>
        </a>
        <p style="font-family:'GillSans',sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:rgba(255,241,218,0.35);margin-top:10px;line-height:1.6;">Add us on LINE to receive your member welcome message and stay connected with the Bianca Club.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="club-reveal" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px);transition:all 0.7s ease 0.3s;">
      <div style="background:#FFF1DA;padding:48px 40px;">
        <div style="font-family:'Satisfy',cursive;font-size:28px;color:#235E44;margin-bottom:6px;">Join the club</div>
        <p style="font-family:'GillSans',sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#666;margin-bottom:8px;line-height:1.7;">Membership is free. Fill in your details and we'll welcome you via LINE OA.</p>
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:rgba(6,199,85,0.08);border:1px solid rgba(6,199,85,0.2);padding:10px 14px;margin-bottom:28px;">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#06C755"><path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12c0 4.95 3.61 9.05 8.34 9.82V15.5H8.5v-2.5h1.84v-1.6c0-1.82 1.08-2.82 2.74-2.82.79 0 1.62.14 1.62.14v1.78h-.91c-.9 0-1.18.56-1.18 1.13v1.37h2.01l-.32 2.5h-1.69v6.32C18.39 21.05 22 16.95 22 12c0-5.52-4.48-10-10-10z"/></svg>
          <span style="font-family:'GillSans',sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#235E44;font-weight:500;">Membership confirmed via LINE OA @biancabangkok</span>
        </div>

        <div id="club-form">
          <div style="margin-bottom:16px;">
            <label style="font-family:'GillSans',sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#235E44;display:block;margin-bottom:8px;">Full name</label>
            <input id="club-name" type="text" placeholder="Your name" style="width:100%;padding:13px 16px;background:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(35,94,68,0.15);font-family:'GillSans',sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#1a1a1a;outline:none;transition:border-color 0.2s;box-sizing:border-box;" onfocus="this.style.borderColor='#235E44'" onblur="this.style.borderColor='rgba(35,94,68,0.15)'" />
          </div>
          <div style="margin-bottom:16px;">
            <label style="font-family:'GillSans',sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#235E44;display:block;margin-bottom:8px;">Email address</label>
            <input id="club-email" type="email" placeholder="your@email.com" style="width:100%;padding:13px 16px;background:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(35,94,68,0.15);font-family:'GillSans',sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#1a1a1a;outline:none;transition:border-color 0.2s;box-sizing:border-box;" onfocus="this.style.borderColor='#235E44'" onblur="this.style.borderColor='rgba(35,94,68,0.15)'" />
          </div>
          <div style="margin-bottom:16px;">
            <label style="font-family:'GillSans',sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#235E44;display:block;margin-bottom:8px;">Phone number</label>
            <input id="club-phone" type="tel" placeholder="+66 8X XXX XXXX" style="width:100%;padding:13px 16px;background:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(35,94,68,0.15);font-family:'GillSans',sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#1a1a1a;outline:none;transition:border-color 0.2s;box-sizing:border-box;" onfocus="this.style.borderColor='#235E44'" onblur="this.style.borderColor='rgba(35,94,68,0.15)'" />
          </div>
          <div style="margin-bottom:28px;">
            <label style="font-family:'GillSans',sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#235E44;display:block;margin-bottom:8px;">Favourite location</label>
            <select id="club-location" style="width:100%;padding:13px 16px;background:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(35,94,68,0.15);font-family:'GillSans',sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#1a1a1a;outline:none;transition:border-color 0.2s;cursor:pointer;box-sizing:border-box;">
              <option value="">Select a location</option>
              <option>One Bangkok</option>
              <option>Emsphere</option>
              <option>Siam Paragon</option>
              <option>ICONSIAM</option>
              <option>Terminal 21 Asoke</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <button onclick="joinClub()" style="width:100%;background:#235E44;color:#FFF1DA;border:none;cursor:pointer;padding:16px;font-family:'GillSans',sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;transition:all 0.3s;margin-bottom:12px;" onmouseover="this.style.background='#FAB31E';this.style.color='#235E44'" onmouseout="this.style.background='#235E44';this.style.color='#FFF1DA'">Become a member</button>
          <a href="https://line.me/R/ti/p/@biancabangkok" target="_blank" style="display:block;width:100%;background:#06C755;color:#fff;border:none;cursor:pointer;padding:14px;font-family:'GillSans',sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;transition:all 0.3s;text-align:center;text-decoration:none;box-sizing:border-box;" onmouseover="this.style.opacity='0.85'" onmouseout="this.style.opacity='1'">Or add us on LINE OA directly</a>
          <p style="font-family:'GillSans',sans-serif;font-size:11px;color:#999;text-align:center;margin-top:14px;line-height:1.6;">Free membership. No payment required.</p>
        </div>

        <div id="club-success" style="display:none;text-align:center;padding:20px 0;">
          <div style="font-family:'Satisfy',cursive;font-size:32px;color:#235E44;margin-bottom:12px;">Welcome to the club.</div>
          <p style="font-family:'GillSans',sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:300;color:#666;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:20px;">Add us on LINE OA to receive your member welcome and stay connected with the Bianca Club.</p>
          <a href="https://line.me/R/ti/p/@biancabangkok" target="_blank" style="display:inline-block;background:#06C755;color:#fff;padding:13px 28px;text-decoration:none;font-family:'GillSans',sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;transition:opacity 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.opacity='0.85'" onmouseout="this.style.opacity='1'">Add @biancabangkok on LINE</a>
          <div style="margin-top:20px;font-family:'GillSans',sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#FAB31E;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;">— The BIANCA team</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<script>
  function joinClub(){
    const name = document.getElementById('club-name').value.trim();
    const email = document.getElementById('club-email').value.trim();
    if(!name){
      document.getElementById('club-name').style.borderColor='#C8262A';
      setTimeout(()=>document.getElementById('club-name').style.borderColor='rgba(35,94,68,0.15)',1500);
      return;
    }
    if(!email||!email.includes('@')){
      document.getElementById('club-email').style.borderColor='#C8262A';
      setTimeout(()=>document.getElementById('club-email').style.borderColor='rgba(35,94,68,0.15)',1500);
      return;
    }
    document.getElementById('club-form').style.display='none';
    document.getElementById('club-success').style.display='block';
  }

  const clubItems = document.querySelectorAll('.club-reveal');
  const clubObs = new IntersectionObserver(entries=>{
    entries.forEach(e=>{ if(e.isIntersecting){ e.target.style.opacity='1'; e.target.style.transform='translateY(0)'; } });
  },{threshold:0.1});
  clubItems.forEach(el=>clubObs.observe(el));
</script>
